t both legs can be seen well. And please make sure to remove the stocking of the character.\nPlease draw the character's sleeve up to the elbow so that the skin is exposed from the elbow to the hand.\n\nCover the hat obliquely so that the character's headline is completely or almost completely visible. If this is difficult, please remove the hat altogether.\n\nPlease draw the character's breasts bigger than the original image. I hope it's similar to the pictures in the following link: ( https://twitter.com/tarenegima/status/1332308988881379328/photo/1 // \nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/88480064 \n) (Please note that the end of the first link is 'photo/1')\n\nIf the cape worn by the character covers the character's breasts and makes it difficult to reveal the breasts, you can make the cape walk up a little like the following link to reveal the line below the breasts.\n(As if the cape were flying lightly in the wind) (https://imgur.com/a/INQF6Je)\n\nPlease maintain the thickness and leg line of the thigh as the image of the next link, rather than the character's thighs and legs as thin as the original image.\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/88480064 //\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/89031002 // )\n\nThank you for reading my long request.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tarenegima/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 823502, "client_id": 488162, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1618983f/uploads/origins/4c1c9d6a-11fb-4451-b878-7a480768af3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5de4f3cd67d6344ed1901b059b75784a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1618983f/uploads/origins/4c1c9d6a-11fb-4451-b878-7a480768af3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5de4f3cd67d6344ed1901b059b75784a, https://si.imgix.net/1618983f/uploads/origi